-----------------------------------------------------------------------
WORK BY KARANVEER SINGH (JARVIS-LV)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

Everything below was added to or changed from Mark LV in JARVIS-LV:

  - Offline assistant: rule-based fallback for when there is no internet
    or every Gemini model is rate-limited, with Whisper/Vosk speech
    (core/offline_assistant.py, core/offline_skills.py,
    core/offline_voice.py, core/offline_history.py, open_close_apps.py)
  - Floating robot and chat window, the default interface (ui_chat.py,
    assets/)
  - 21 extra tools: calculator, notes, timer, shell_command,
    process_manager, system_toggles, spotify, powerpoint, image_generate,
    logins (encrypted vault), clipboard_history, file_tools,
    network_tools, screenshot, daily_briefing, everyday, site_to_file,
    personality, lessons, routines, tool_builder
  - Self-improvement switches: remembered facts, learned corrections,
    noticed routines, tool building, approved package installs
    (core/lessons.py, core/routines.py)
  - Confirmation gate extended to stopping programs, non-read-only shell
    commands, quitting and package installs
  - English start-up greeting
  - Portable one-file Windows installer (portable/)
  - Tests (tests/)
  - Project documentation (JARVIS-LV_Documentation_updated.pdf)

